1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,531
My son, you asked me what Ethiopia is.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:14,080
Today I want to show you everything my father showed me.

3
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:22,120
These mountains quietly keep the story of our ancestors.

4
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:30,880
Churches carved from a single rock, built with faith and patience.

5
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:40,680
Under the warka tree, the elders taught us love and forgiveness.

6
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:48,440
When the coffee is roasted, its aroma gathers the whole house.

7
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:55,520
One cup, one table, one family.

8
00:00:56,520 --> 00:01:02,760
And today, your generation is writing a new story.

9
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:08,320
Your dreams and your hard work are my hope.

10
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:14,800
Wherever you go, you carry all of this with you.

11
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:22,960
You carry us. You carry your roots.
